==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vrosch}}, from {{inh|de|goh|frosc||frog}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*fruskaz||frog}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*prew-||jump, hop}}. Cognate with {{cog|gml|vorsch||frog}}, {{cog|nl|vors}}, {{cog|fy|froask}}, {{cog|is|froskur}}, {{cog|en|frosh||frog}}. More at {{l|en|frosh}}.

